  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/658928958/v0.40.16</id>
    <updated>2026-11-09T23:45:36Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.16"/>
    <title>v0.40.16</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;Ripple Preview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ollama.com/library/ripple-preview&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Ripple Preview&lt;/a&gt; from Ricursive Intelligence is a 65B dense model built for agentic coding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto&quot; data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=&quot;ollama run ripple-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;pre&gt;ollama run ripple-preview&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qwen3.8 Flash Next uses about 27 GiB less memory on Apple silicon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ollama launch claude&lt;/code&gt; always routes Claude Code to the selected model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ollama launch&lt;/code&gt; explains when a cloud model has been retired&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;/v1/responses&lt;/code&gt; respects &lt;code&gt;truncation&lt;/code&gt; and no longer silently truncates by default&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;/v1/models&lt;/code&gt; returns an empty list instead of &lt;code&gt;null&lt;/code&gt; when no models are installed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CUDA 13.5 support for Windows on ARM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated llama.cpp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.40.15...v0.40.16&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.40.15...v0.40.16&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>github-actions[bot]</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
