    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/658928958/v0.40.16-rc0</id>
    <updated>2026-11-08T00:36:53Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.16-rc0"/>
    <title>v0.40.16-rc0: Add ripple preview support to the MLX runner (#19592)</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Add the Ripple model, renderer, parser and import registration.&lt;br&gt;
Support per-layer NoPE in DFlash drafts.&lt;br&gt;
Fuse MLP activation, value blending and attention gating.&lt;br&gt;
Add reference fixtures and model/runner regression tests.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>pdevine</name>
    </author>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75239?s=60&amp;v=4"/>
