  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/658928958/v0.40.15</id>
    <updated>2026-11-06T01:47:18Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.15"/>
    <title>v0.40.15</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;MiMo V2.6&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Xiaomi MiMo&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://ollama.com/library/mimo-v2.6&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;mimo-v2.6&lt;/a&gt;, a 9B model built for code and agent workflows, is now supported in Ollama.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto&quot; data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=&quot;ollama run mimo-v2.6&quot;&gt;&lt;pre&gt;ollama run mimo-v2.6&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;AutoTrust decision models&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ollama.com/library/autotrust-jev&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;AutoTrust&lt;/a&gt; decision models read text and return choices, yes or no probabilities, and ratings for the questions you supply. The family includes 9b, 35b, and 27b-vl sizes — the 35b and 27b-vl sizes can also read images.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto&quot; data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=&quot;ollama run autotrust-jev &amp;quot;A customer says their card was charged twice.&amp;quot; --ask &amp;quot;Is this a billing issue?&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;pre&gt;ollama run autotrust-jev &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-pds&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;A customer says their card was charged twice.&lt;span class=&quot;pl-pds&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --ask &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-pds&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;Is this a billing issue?&lt;span class=&quot;pl-pds&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: autotrust-jev is supported on Apple silicon in this release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ollama launch now supports Kimi Code CLI — the successor to kimi-cli — and offers to migrate existing kimi-cli setups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ollama launch now fills in Pi&#39;s model list automatically so models can be picked inside Pi, and Claude Desktop&#39;s model&lt;br&gt;
picker shows Ollama&#39;s actual model names&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recurrent and vision GGUF models can now serve more than one request at a time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qwen3 and Qwen3.5 models using long-context (YaRN) scaling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running ollama with no arguments opens the welcome launcher&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.40.14...v0.40.15&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.40.14...v0.40.15&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
