  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/658928958/v0.40.14</id>
    <updated>2026-11-03T06:57:31Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.14"/>
    <title>v0.40.14</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ollama launch claude&lt;/code&gt; now applies the model&#39;s output token limit for Claude Code, so cloud models no longer run into the 128k default cap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud web search responses on &lt;code&gt;/api/chat&lt;/code&gt; are now decoded correctly, including compressed responses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OpenAI-compatible endpoints no longer override a model&#39;s packaged sampler defaults — clients that send no &lt;code&gt;temperature&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;top_p&lt;/code&gt; get the model&#39;s own values instead of 1.0, matching &lt;code&gt;/api/chat&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;/v1/responses&lt;/code&gt; now preserves readable input content, including prior assistant refusals, instead of flattening it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ollama&#39;s app can now retry ChatGPT disconnect failures instead of leaving the connection in a broken state&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ollama launch codex&lt;/code&gt; verifies ChatGPT routing before configuring, and reports a clear error when routing is unavailable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faster top-k sampling on MLX for large vocabularies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.40.13...v0.40.14&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.40.13...v0.40.14&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
