    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;LFM3 on Linux and Windows&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Liquid AI&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://ollama.com/library/lfm3&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;LFM3&lt;/a&gt; models, including text-to-speech in &lt;a href=&quot;https://ollama.com/library/lfm3-audio&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;lfm3-audio&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://ollama.com/library/lfm3-omni&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;lfm3-omni&lt;/a&gt;, now run on Linux and Windows as well as Apple silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
